window.products.push({"id":1164007,"name":"Round Stone Coasters 4 Pack With Wood Storage Caddy Islands of Hawaii","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wAdtWmZhL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Add style and function to any table with coasters made of absorbent ceramic for extra-strength liquid/condensation absorption. Great for easy clean-up. Each coaster has a soft cork backing to protect your precious furniture. Set includes four coasters stacked in a convenient wooden storage caddy. Coasters measure 4-1/16” in diameter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wAdtWmZhL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Welcome to the Islands","source_asin":"B01M5LAOJG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M5LAOJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M5LAOJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164008,"name":"Boston International 8 Count Caskata Studio Round Paper Dinner Plates, Blue Crab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EtmbuT1wL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Cassata Studio napkins and plates begin with exquisite imagery but don't end there. As beautiful as they are practical, Ideal Home Range plates are made of heavyweight cardboard with a gloss finish that will hold up to heaping helpings. Arrange stunning place settings by pairing patterned plates with matching napkins and coordinating solids. Plates and napkins are offered in multiple sizes, allowing you to create dynamic, layered tables capes. IHR offers a sustainable option for conscientious consumers, using ink that is water soluble, contains no heavy metals or solvents of any kind and meets the requirements of German Food and Health laws and the USFDA. Used ink is never dumped into sewage and is always recycled and reintegrated into the color system. The production working area is naturally pollution-free and no harmful emissions are produced. IHR has earned a certificate of approval from the Forest Stewardship Council (FSC), a prestigious certificate only awarded to those who meet all of the FSC's standards for sustainability, forest management, well being of the forest workers and effects on indigenous peoples and the local environment. Ideal Home Range is exclusively represented in the United States by Boston International and is considered to be the international market leader and trendsetter in the field of high-class table decoration and interior accessories. IHR began in an old village school in Germany in 1977, when Ingrid and Hanja Rick conceived the idea of producing accessories in the arts and crafts tradition in order to communicate their concept of interior design. They soon discovered the tissue napkin as a design object and the basis of stylish table decorations and turned it into the key feature of their product. More than 8,000 items are offered today in most countries of the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EtmbuT1wL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston International","source_asin":"B01D1P6Q26","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01D1P6Q26","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01D1P6Q26","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164009,"name":"Rasasi Royale EDP - 75 ml (For Men)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4109hn6uWnL._AC_.jpg","description":"Royale for Men by Rasasi Perfume EDT Spray. Rasasi impresses and flatters your senses with their unique fragrances that last long and keep you smelling fresh. These are fragrances that will please the royals just as it would appeal to your more earthy senses. Each and every one of their perfumes are keepers. The top notes are a harmonious blend of citrus notes, bergamot and tangerine. The tender and fruity blends of the berries and red fruits, brings out the charm for women perfectly. It is supported by the softness of honey, vanilla and musk in the background warmed up by precious sandalwood. Rasasi Royale is an exotic spray perfume for men which comes in an innovative glass flask. contents - Perfume 75 ml.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4109hn6uWnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RASASI","source_asin":"4154123688","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/4154123688","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"4154123688","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164010,"name":"Casserole Carrier and Food Warmer with Large Dual Use Hot Cold Pack - (Holds up to 11\"x17\" Casserole)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yKwXEjn9L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Casserole Carrier Bag - Portable Travel Casserole Tote - Perfect for picnics, BBQs, or transporting your favorite hot dish to a party, this versatile casserole tote from Camerons Products features a durable, insulated high-temp polyester interior liner with a cotton/poly blend exterior in black, suitable for any occasion. The top cover piece unzips all the way around, allowing for easy placement of your hot casserole dish inside, and has a velcro-closure pocket on the top for storing a utensils, seasonings, a kitchen towel, or oven mitt. The sturdy dual handles make for easy transport. This casserole carrier easily holds up to a 11-inch by 17-inch baking dish and will keep food warm for up to an hour, and offers a convenient way to share your favorite recipe with friends. For best results, machine wash in cold water, remove and turn inside out to air dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yKwXEjn9L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Camerons","source_asin":"B00G3UXQ2A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G3UXQ2A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G3UXQ2A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164011,"name":"Biddeford Velour Sherpa Electric Heated Warming Throw Blanket Claret Washable Auto Shut Off 6 Heat Settings","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YMdK9UIwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This Biddeford Velour Sherpa Electric Heated Throw Blanket is just the thing to warm you up on cold winter nights. This comfortable warming throw blanket is perfect for getting rid of the chills. The Controller has 6 heat settings and 10 hour auto off, allowing you to get just the right temperature and allows you to turn down your thermostat to save energy and money. The therapeutic heat settings can be controlled so you stay comfy whether sleeping in or just relaxing on your couch. The blanket warms up fast and is efficient in keeping you comforted. Do not cover or wrap the controller and make sure both items are in a well ventilated area when in use. Additional safety certification for this product can be viewed on the UL or Intertek websites. Overheat protection promotes a safe user experience. Reference included safety instructions before use to ensure safe operation. Air dry or tumble dry on low heat, wash alone, do not bleach and do not iron. IMPORTANT - NOT for infants, children, incapacitated person or animals and pets. Throw Size 50\"\" X 60\"\" ***Note for Customers Outside of North America. These heated bedding products were made to work with 110V Electrical systems. If you live in a country that utilizes a different electrical system you may need to use a converter for these products to function. The act of using a converter automatically voids the warranty on these products. **All Biddeford Blankets are rigorously tested and approved by a third party (UL or ETK Intertek) to comply with current industry safety standards. Please reference the included use and safety instructions and attached product label picture to insure safe operation. Additional safety certification for this product can be viewed on the UL or Intertek websites or by calling their perspective customer care phone numbers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YMdK9UIwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Biddeford Blankets","source_asin":"B07VDB7RTK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VDB7RTK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VDB7RTK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164012,"name":"MISS FANTASY 143PCS St Patrick's Day Window Clings Stickers St Patricks Day Window Decorations St Pattys Day Window Decals for The Home Classroom…","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51l+HGE0jUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Are you ready for the St.Patrick’s Day? Are you looking for something lovely for the coming St.Patrick’s Day? Then our St.Patrick’s Day Window Clings Stickers will be a great choice! These St.Patrick's day window clings stickers are printed on high quality adhesive paper, with vibrant colors. Self-adhesive, premium material, can be stick on any smooth and clean surface like glass wall, plastic products, mirrors, windows and so on. Perfect as window sticker, refrigerator stickers, floor sticker and party decoration. Features: Reliable material: These shamrock,gold coin,leprechaun footprints stickers are made of premium material, which is lightweight and easy to carry, touch smooth on the surface, durable and long-lasting. Unique patterns: A variety of different patterns can meet your various needs, and bright color can make your home become more attractive, give you a different using experience. Suitable occasions: You can decorate St.Patrick's day stickers in a clean and smooth place, such as mirrors, windows, floors, glass door,shop window pane, ceramic tiles in kitchen or bathroom, glasses, home appliance, air-condition, office, dorm or retail store , coffee house, restaurant , supermarket , dress shop. Specifications: Sizes: 14.56\" x 11.22\" each sheet Material: PVC Package includes: 4 sheets of St.Patrick’s Day Window Clings Stickers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51l+HGE0jUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MISS FANTASY","source_asin":"B083RSG7T7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083RSG7T7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083RSG7T7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164013,"name":"CHARMAID Vanity Set with Tri-Folding Mirror and Cushioned Stool, Dressing Table with 7 Drawers and a Shelf, Makeup Table Writing Desk with Removable T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uiJ63-e8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"7 Drawers & Spacious Tabletop: Equipped with 7 drawers and a shelf, there is enough storage space for you to categorize and place different kinds of cosmetics. The knob of the drawer is designed like an exquisite flower for easy opening and closing. On the smooth and ample tabletop, some of your daily accessories can be placed for convenient taking. Two Tri-folding with One Rotated Mirrors: The two side mirrors of this makeup vanity table can be folded or opened in line with middle one. And the mirror in the middle can be pivoted at any angle to cooperate with side mirrors to get better light which allows you to get the most natural application of makeup. Dual-Use Desk with Removable Top: The top of the dresser can be detached and the rest of the dresser is a practical desk. It can be placed in your bedroom or study room for studying, reading or writing. The tabletop is larger than before and there are still five drawers to help you store some sundries. Selected Materials for Durable Use: The legs of dresser and stool are made of solid wood to ensure the sturdiness and will provide large weight capacity. The set is stable and not easy to be deformed. With environmentally friendly coating, the surface of the set is scratchproof and waterproof to prevent color-fading. Soft & Multifunctional Padded Stool: The thick padding with nice printing pattern is bonding with the stool and super comfortable to sit on it with high resilience. At the bottom of the leg, there is a pad to prevent slip and scrap to the floor. And the stool also can be used separately as an ottoman, desk chair and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uiJ63-e8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHARMAID","source_asin":"B07WBVLNL9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WBVLNL9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WBVLNL9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164014,"name":"W Trading- Professional Kitchen Knives Custom Made Damascus Steel 8 pcs of Professional Utility Cooking Chef Kitchen Knife Set with Chopper/Cleaver wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZLXPQMWUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size: From Top to bottom 1: Overall 14.6\", Handle 5\" Blade 9.6\" --------- 2: Overall 13\", Handle 5\" Blade 8\" --------- 3: Overall 11.5\", Handle 5\" Blade 6.5\" --------- 4: Overall 12\", Handle 5\" Blade 7\" --------- 5: Overall 11\", Handle 5\" Blade 6\" --------- 6: Overall 11.2\", Handle 5\" Blade 6.2\" --------- 7: Overall 8.7\", Handle 5\" Blade 3.7\" --------- 1: Overall 9\", Handle 5\" Blade 4\" --------- The High Grade Damascus steel used for these blades consists of layers of low carbon & high carbon (1095&15N20) mixture welded, forged and hammered several times to obtain Up to 200 Layers. The hardness of these blades is up to 56 to 58 HRC on the Rockwell scale providing sharp edges that are designed for lots of use. Precision heat treating methods are employed to provide the sharpest, most enduring edges available. Only quality materials have been used to create this beautiful Knife. For the collectors this knife is stylish and built to last. How to care for your new knives: ~ Store in a dry place, moisture encourages rust. Damascus is very easy to clean if rusted but is rust resistant. ~ After use, wash and dry the blade & apply vegetable oil, or any food safe lubricating oil. ~ Sometimes Damascus steel darkens with age. To brighten up the blade, sand it lengthwise with a worn piece of sand paper. This just hits the raised portions of the etched pattern and makes the blade look brighter. No two items are ever identical; the item you receive may be slightly different to the pictures shown. Damascus steel is a refined method of forging steel where the anvil and the hammer determine just what kind of knife is made each time. The use of natural materials i.e., buffalo horn, stag horn, wood and camel bone means that variations in color and slight imperfections may be present but make each knife that much more unique.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZLXPQMWUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"W Trading","source_asin":"B09F9GB8HC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F9GB8HC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F9GB8HC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
