window.products.push({"id":1164081,"name":"WHOLEV Preserved Rose with Necklace Changing Color Temperature Sense, Romantic Mother‘s Day Rose Gift Never Withered Eternal Rose Flower for Wedding A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cDmjAUpSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⚡⚡⚡Here Comes the Satisfying Gift!, Filling the Air with Sweet!⚡⚡⚡ 💕【Rose That Never Fades】Rose is a symbol of eternal love. WHOLEV roses are made in a unique way. People call it \"the flower that never fades\", which means \"eternal love\". Eternal Rose fully retains the flower characteristics that symbolize eternal love, so that your love will always be fresh. In addition, roses have no pollen, and people who are allergic to pollen can also receive this wonderful gift. 💕【How to Use the Temperature-Sensitive Necklace】The pendant necklace is placed in the eternal rose box. The gemstones of the necklace can different color with the change of temperature. Different temperatures will change different colors. The color has a gradient effect, which will look better than our picture (the color on the picture may not be accurate enough, because it is Natural color changing gemstone, we can't draw its color exactly, its color looks better than the picture) 💕【\"Scheming\" Small Design】The rose gift box has a unique creativity. You think it is just a simple rose gift box with preserved flowers, but after you open it, you will find that there is a heartbeat gift on the right. You can place your personal gifts like rings, necklaces or earrings in the sponge box for a surprise. When your lover or friend receives the rose gift box, she will feel so much joy and happiness, it will make you feel that it is all worth it! 💕【Exquisite Rose Gift Box】On the left side of the rose gift box is eternal roses, which represents \"Best Wishes\" with \"Each flower & gift tells a story To the one I love\" . The entire gift box is designed in noble and elegant island blue, with bronzing patterns and letters, showing low-key luxury. The rose gift box is the best choice for Valentine's Day gift. 💕【Wide Apply】 You can write your blessings and love on the greeting card, it will be the perfect gift for marriage proposal, wedding, anniversary, birthday, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas or any other day special. Show him your infinite love forever. It is also an ideal choice for home and office decoration.The WHOLEV Rose Box represents your eternal love. The rose is a symbol of love and grace. 💕【You Will Get】The eternal rose gift box contains: 1. Exquisite rose gift box (the jewelry gift box contains handmade roses and temperature sensing changing color pendant necklace) 2. Pink heart-shaped greeting card (you can write your most sincere wishes to her Blessing) 3. Exquisite island blue gift bag (you can put the rose gift box and greeting card into the gift bag to make the gift more precious and advanced)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cDmjAUpSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WHOLEV","source_asin":"B0BP6RW69S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP6RW69S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP6RW69S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
