window.products.push({"id":1164177,"name":"LIVEBOX Marble Area Rug Runner, 2x4.3ft Modern Abstract Gold and Turquoise Distressed Faux Wool Rug Plush Accent Throw Rug Oriental Floor Mat for Entr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t7djfW-xL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"LIVEBOX Marble Area Rugs Modern Abstract Contemporary Design Gold and Turquoise Floor Mat Area rugs can be powerful design tools, whether they act as artwork for the floor or simply provide a complementary background for the other decor. Imagine taking a room with a black and white rug and switching it out for gold and turquoise version, or exchanging a Moroccan tile print for a marble . With just this one simple switch, a room can go from traditional to modern. LIVEBOX marble rug features a vintage inspired motif in a warm palette of gold, turquoise, green, royal blue. Beautiful for dining areas, entrance and more, this indoor rug is delightfully versatile and durable. LIVEBOX abstract rug is also available in sizes plus many more in the future. Product Features: There are 4 size:2’×3’ft:small rug used as bath,kitchen,door mat 2’×4.2’ft: rug runner for porch,entryway ,laundry 3’×5’ft,4’×6’ft:large distressed floor mat for bedroom and living roomThickness: 0.41 inch. Quality You Can See: LIVEBOX entrance rug is made with only the best materials!Affordable & Elegant: These designs add abstract elements while fitting your budgets! Satisfaction Guarantee: If you are not satisfied with colorful rugs, plz feel free to contact us. We stand by our area rugs 100%! Cleaning Instructions: We recommend spot clean with mild soap or detergent, and dry evenly. Vacuum regularly to revive the fibers and present a brand new, fresh look. We do not recommend machine washing. Notice: 1.Due to the light and screen difference. the item's color may be slightly different from the pictures.2.Because it's folded during shipment, the marble area rug will have some creases. Please distribute one to two nights before using. 3. Please allow 1-3cm differences due to manual measurement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t7djfW-xL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIVEBOX","source_asin":"B08PYLDV9P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PYLDV9P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PYLDV9P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
