window.products.push({"id":1164342,"name":"Coffee Grinder, LHS Adjustable Manual Burr Coffee Grinder with Two Containers Ceramic Hand Coffee Grinder Mill with Refillable Lids for Aeropress, Dri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vFXO-XdnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"✔ TRADITIONAL BUT EXCELLENT COFFEE GRINDER MANUAL - Grinding coffee beans by hand is one of the traditional methods of manual coffee preparation. However, this is never out of date. Our Professional Ceramic Combination Sharpener and Coffee Bean Grinder will not create too much frictional heat to spoil the taste of the coffee beans. ✔ BUILT IN 4 ADJUSTABLE GROUND OPTIONS - We offer four coffee grind thicknesses. The knob in the middle of the manual burr coffee grinder has 4 grind settings from fine to coarse, so you can easily adjust the thickness or fineness of the powder. Perfect for making Turkish coffee, espresso, siphon and French coffee. ✔ TWO CAPACITY COFFEE GROUND CONTAINER - You can precisely control the number of cups you brew with a freshly ground hand coffee mill. Because we offer two capacity options. The small-capacity box can brew coffee for 1-2 people, and the large-capacity box can brew coffee for 3-4 people. ✔ A COFFEE LOVER'S CHOICE - I am sure you who choose a manual coffee bean grinder will love your coffee and enjoy the making process. Enjoying your own coffee is a wonderful thing. bring it on! An energizing morning starts with a smooth, full-bodied cup of coffee! Hand pour coffee machine can give you such a good feeling! ✔ EASY TO USE AND CLEAN - Add your favorite coffee beans from the port, then quickly grind and shake into your plate! There is an airtight cover on top to keep it clean and keep out moisture and dust. When cleaning, thoroughly clean the hand coffee grinder mill with a mild detergent. The cleaning method is simple and convenient.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vFXO-XdnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LHS","source_asin":"B087B4PF6H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087B4PF6H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087B4PF6H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164343,"name":"LuxUrux Bath Mat-Extra-Soft Plush Bath Shower Bathroom Rug,1'' Chenille Microfiber Material, Super Absorbent Shaggy Bath Rug. Machine Wash & Dry (24 x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81htehn+A0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXTRA SOFT BATH RUG MAT: Cushion those cold bathrooms tiles with LuxUrux’s luxuriously soft 1’’ high after-bath mat rug. Our mat is designed to fit perfectly in front of your Bathtub, sink, Vanity & Etc. with the right size Making it Perfect for master bathroom, kids bathroom, vanity & guest suite. Great gift idea for all occasions, Christmas, Wedding, Fathers Day, Mothers Day, Valentines, Birth Day & Etc. SUPER ABSORBENT AND FAST DRYING MATERIAL: The mats are made of thousands of individual microfiber High-pile, thick Chenille fabric helps save your floors from dripping water while you're stepping out of the Shower, Jacuzzi, Bath, or getting ready by the sink. Moisture is trapped in the mat's 1'' deep pile, allowing the rug to dry quickly and cleanly leaving the mat fresh, dry and always free of any mold or mildew. !CAUTION: Place mat on DRY FLAT SURFACE only. Water under rug can cause it to slip. Always Keep bottom of rug dry BETTER & LONGER LASTING MATERIALS: The durable materials and high-quality construction ensure that it will not deteriorate, flatten or fall apart with use. Use every day, and wash regularly. This mat will look great, and stay functional for many years to come. Its Color will not fade. Color will stay nice and vibrant for years to come no matter how many times they’ll be washed and dried MACHINE WASHABLE: Both the chenille microfiber and the PVC layer used in the mat are designed to be machine washable to get stains out. unlike other brands where the rubber backing tends to wear and peel off after a number of washes. For best results, wash on cold and lightly tumble dry on low heat. GUARANTEE - Love it or your money back! Life time warranty by LuxUrux. If you are not satisfied with your rug or if you decide that this is not for you, then please do not hesitate and reach out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81htehn+A0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LuxUrux","source_asin":"B08BKVFV7G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BKVFV7G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BKVFV7G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
