window.products.push({"id":1164407,"name":"HDCRYSTALGIFTS Turkish Blue Evil Eye Lucky Tree with Golden Owl Figurines Table Decor Ornaments Lucky Life for Home Protection Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jOuflK4-L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"🦉Material:This golden fortune tree with lucky golden owl blue evil eye made of Resin and glass,size: expand 8.0in,Unexpanded 5.1in,nw:300g,with 7 golden owl blue evil eyes. 🦉Regulate:This golden fortune tree branches are adjustable so that you can arrange your tree,very convenient and fast,Under the golden tree is a big blue evil eye base 🦉Use:Blue devil eyes tree brings luck, prosperity, provides protection against any kind of losses, and in Feng Shui against harmful energy.Makes you with positive energy 🦉Gift Ideal:The golden evil eye trees perfect to deflect negative energy, These trees protect your,So it is the great home decor and Wedding gift idea. 🦉Purchase:Features golden owl with Evil Eye centers.The tops of the branches are flexible and can be regulate.This is an pretty way to decorate a table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jOuflK4-L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HDCRYSTALGIFTS","source_asin":"B08G8CD647","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G8CD647","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G8CD647","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164408,"name":"ASHCROFT Serena Mid-Century Modern Genuine Leather Upholstered Bench in Tan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cyGVKYbGL._AC_.jpg","description":"A mid-century modern upgrade to a classic retro, the Serena upholstered bench is wonderfully adaptable. Its seat cushion is made of high-quality genuine leather and filled with high-density foam that provides a comfortable seat for up to 2. This bronzed accent bench is made with a sturdy solid wood frame and has tapered solid wood legs in a rich finish to convey a refined aesthetic with a touch of mid-century style. It can be cleaned with a non-abrasive cleaning solution followed by a fast microfiber cloth. The removable legs allow easy delivery for tight spaces. Available in a variety of timeless colors, you're sure to find something to match your decor. Requires partial assembly. Due to the natural characteristics of leather, texture and color may vary. Features: - Mid-century furniture design. - Solid wood legs. - Hand stitched - Durable upholstery. - Genuine leather. - The simple attachment of the leg is the only necessary assembly. - Made in Indonesia. - Furniture pattern: solid - High density foam cushion. - Espresso brown color/finish. - Contemporary style. - Shape: Rectangle - Leather care: To keep your leather fresh and hydrated, use leather conditioners and/or wipes every few months. Do not use harmful chemicals on leather. - Flawless craftsmanship that ensures long-lasting strength and durability. Specifications: - Assembly required: Yes. - Leg dimensions: 6.5 inches. - Ottoman dimensions: 18 inches high x 43 inches wide x 13 inches deep - Ottoman weight capacity: 200 lbs. - Hardware: solid wood. - Product weight: 20 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cyGVKYbGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASHCROFT","source_asin":"B07YLRB17X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YLRB17X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YLRB17X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164409,"name":"Silverware Set, HOBO 24-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Set With Titanium Gold Plated, Golden Color Flatware Set, Silverware, Cutlery Set Service For 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X6EoU4y8L._AC_SL1494_.jpg","description":"【Golden Color Silverware Set】24 piece unique flatware set including 6 Dinner knives, 6 dinner Forks, 6 table Spoons, 6 tea Spoons.This flatware set is made of premium stainless steel with exquisite mirror polish. The fork, knife, and spoon are heat-resistant and rust-resistant. They are comfortable to hold and durable for daily use. 【Lustrous Gold Silverware Set】With this titanium gold plated stainless steel flatware set ,you can enjoy a stylish, shiny and generous dining adventure each and every night.Enjoy the lustrous colors of the gold and watch your dinner guests burst with delight as they settle in for a memorable meal with your new golden stainless steel tableware. Perfect for families on the move looking for fashion-forward stylish flatware. 【Adopting PVD Coating】This golden flatware set adopts for PVD-coated. Physical Vapor Deposition (PVD) gives a part a decorative appearance as well as added strength and durability. It represents a group of coating fabrication processes that are made in an artificially created vacuum.This silverware set is eco-friendly, more lightweight and lower maintenance than electroplated set. 【Beautifully Packaged Box】Perfect gift for Mother's Day, Weddings, Valentine's Day, Catered events, Birthday party, Gathering, Family reunion, Upscale catering, Gift Theme restaurant, home dinner and more. And also, this eating utensils set can be a perfect daily use. 【100% Guarantee Satisfaction】 If you' re not happy with the golden cutlery set, you can contact us directly through Amazon message and get a full refund.We have a big customer service team provide professional customer service , do not hesitate to contact us when you have any concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X6EoU4y8L._AC_SL1494_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOBO","source_asin":"B07QDXDGD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QDXDGD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QDXDGD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164410,"name":"Blendtec Classic 575 Blender- WildSide+ Jar (90oz) and Four Side Jar (75oz) BUNDLE- 4 Pre-programmed Cycles-5-Speeds - Professional-Grade Power-Self-C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":499.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qXf3TxBgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Classic 575 blender features 5-speed control for variable speed and the ability to achieve a variety of textures. This blender has an LED display with four varying blending options, showing duration and time remaining on blend cycle. The touchscreen controls give the machine a sleek silhouette and are easily wiped clean. It even has reduced motor noise due to internal baffling. Our patented five-sided jar has an extra-wide base and narrow fifth \"\"wild\"\" side to automatically pull ingredients toward the blade instead of just spinning them around like in a circular jar. It increases blending efficiency for frozen ingredients by up to 25% and provides an overall faster, smoother blend. The Wild Side+ jar also features two vertical ridges on the interior walls to disrupt the blending pattern even further. The FourSide jar is ideal for smaller quantities, grinding grains, and heating soups and drinks through friction heat. The square shape automatically pulls ingredients toward the blade, instead of just spinning them around in a circular jar, for hassle-free blending. The flat sides of the FourSide Jar make it simple to scrape out remaining ingredients, and the broad single-blade design allows you to get underneath the blade for any remaining particles. Package Includes: Blendtec Classic 575 Blender Blendtec WildSide+ Jar (90 oz) Blendtec FourSide Jar (75 oz) Jar Dimensions: Blendtec WildSide+ Jar (90 oz): 5\"\" wide, 7\"\" tall, 7\"\" deep Blendtec FourSide Jar (75 oz): 5.37\"\" wide, 9\"\" tall, 5.37\"\" deep Features: Patented single-prong, cold-forged wingtip blade (nearly 3\"\") Easy-to-read jar markings Durable, BPA-free copolyester that stands up to heavy use There's a reason Blendtec is called The World's Most Advanced Blender. With technology to make blending simpler and more effective, Blendtec is the ultimate tool for helping you Feed Your Passion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qXf3TxBgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blendtec","source_asin":"B01K7T6JSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K7T6JSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K7T6JSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
