window.products.push({"id":1164443,"name":"Christmas Snow Globe Lantern Snowglobes Christmas Glitter Christmas Tree Style Snow Globes Musical USB 3AA Battery Operated Snowglobe Glitter Lantern ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ly8xsoh3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique snow globes with music, oil rubbed copper finish. Christmas tree snow scene lights ornaments in the table, there are flying snowflakes inside. Specifications: Material: ABS Plastic Mode: Light ON+Music+Timer/ OFF/ Light ON+Timer Switch: ON1/OFF/ON2 Power Supply: 3 AA Batteries or USB Cable Product Size: 9.5x3.8x12.8inch Product Weight: 3.2lb Color: Bronze Packaging List: 1 x Christmas Lantern Snow Globe 1 x USB to DC Cable 1 x User Manual Musical Snow Globe Christmas Exquisite Design The interior of the snow globe lantern are made of resin and the coloring of the statues is all handmade. Battery operated snow globe is easy for you to decorate the dining table, fireplace, coffee table, nightstand which creates a unique atmosphere for Christmas holiday. 3 AA Batteries or USB to DC Cable Lantern glitter requires 3 AA batteries (Not Included), take off bottom cover and insert the batteries to turn on the battery operated snowglobe. Or you can use the USB to DC cable (Included) to turn on the Christmas snow globes. 6H ON and 18H OFF Timer The Christmas lamp snow globe will light up for 6 hours and then turns off for 18 hours in 24 hours cycle automatically. For example, if you set the timer at 16:00 today, then the small Christmas globes will light up for 6 hours and automatically turn off at 22:00, and automatically turn on again at 16:00 next day, cycle every 24 hours. There is no Music in timer mode for outdoor snow globe for christmas. Winter Snow Globe Gift Lighted snow globe lantern suitable for home decorations, table decorations, etc. Ideal gift choice for your friends and family to celebrate the upcoming Christmas holidays. Music playing function can create a festive celebration atmosphere and provide perfect decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ly8xsoh3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\C","source_asin":"B09LYS2LRR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LYS2LRR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LYS2LRR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164444,"name":"NorthStar Navigation Cube Channel 2 - Compatible with Mint or Braava","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xrhZSQr5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Room 2 Navigation Cube lets you set up an additional area in your home for Mint to clean without having to move the Cube that came with Mint. Great for conveniently setting cleaning areas on a first and second floor, in a bedroom and living room on the same floor or even two ends of a large, open area. To use with Mint, simply place the Room 2 Cube near the middle of a second area of your home you'd like to clean while leaving the Cube that comes with Mint in the first area. Mint will lock on to the nearest Cube. When Mint is done cleaning, simply move it to the other Cube and start it again to clean the second area. It's okay if the cleaning areas of the two Cubes overlap, as Mint will not transition from one area to the other while cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xrhZSQr5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iRobot","source_asin":"B000078JPY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000078JPY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000078JPY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
