window.products.push({"id":1164477,"name":"Venture Horizon 2421-33OA Single Mounted Media Cabinet Multimedia","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SJv97HgjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"You may have seen other Wall Mounted Media Cabinets but you have never come across the styling, variety, storage capacity or value for the money, anywhere. Nobody does it better! We beat the competition...hands down. We offer three (3) sizes in 5 colors. We also did not skimp on the sizing like many other manufacturers. Free up needed floor space. Our Wall Mounted Media Cabinets will indeed hold an entire media collection and then some. Our units hold nearly twice (2X) more media (CD's, DVD's and blue-rays) than our leading competitors. Not only that but our units are also less expensive. All that in a wall hugging slim cabinet design. Shelves are only 6\" deep but a generous 23+\" wide. Each shelf will hold approximately 20 lbs.The 28\" wide Single Cabinet has 5 adjustable shelves plus the fixed base. The 52\" Double has 10 adjustable shelves plus 2 base sections for storage. The 76\" Triple Cabinet has 15 adjustable shelves plus 3 base sections for storage. Our Wall Mounted Media Cabinets are constructed from heavy duty laminated wood composites. The shelves and moldings are made from *MDF (medium density fiberboard) for extra strength and support. Choose from cherry, oak, walnut, black and white. Easy assembly required. Made in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SJv97HgjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Venture Horizon","source_asin":"B0034TD23Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0034TD23Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0034TD23Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
