window.products.push({"id":1164492,"name":"Dofira Acacia Wood Serving Platter with Antler Handles, Decorative Plate Kitchen Organizer, 8\" Round Wooden Food Tray for Snack Fruit Appetizer, Fores","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qc8gXyDoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STUNNING ANTLER DESIGN - This wood serving platter is inspired by natural forest and designed by Dofira USA team. With non-slip pads, it can stay flat and is not easy to bend. The lovely antler complements the natural hues of grains making it not only a kitchen utensil but also a fantastic Christmas decoration! Treat your guests at Christmas gatherings, everyone will be conquered by its beauty! UNFORGETTABLE GIFT - Our Forest Stag Series wood serving tray comes with a classy blue-gold gift box, is perfect for Christmas, housewarmings, birthdays, weddings and anniversaries. The patterns alternated with gold and blue grain emphasize the elegance of package, and cute antler feature drives this decorative Platter to be a lucky gift. Now take this adorable gift with blessings to dear ones! HIGH-QUALITY, CHEMICAL-FREE - Made of 100% premium acacia wood from Thailand's sustainable plantation, only select 50% of a piece of wood without natural defects like scars and wormholes, our wooden snack tray is sturdy, not easy to crack or deform, can last for years! The flat and smooth finish will not create harmful chemicals or wood splinters to stain the food. Dare to enjoy your favorite delicacy! VERSATILE × MULTIPOSE - With perfect size, our antler wood plate is practical to meet your diverse needs. As a food tray for desserts, cheese, snacks, fruits, and appetizers. The lightweight and curved edges make meals carry easy and avoid food dropping. As a storage tray for placing keys, candles, jewelry, or greenery to keep your desktop organized and make things within reach. RELIABLE CRAFTS & WARRANTY - Aesthetics is not at the expense of quality. We use an upgraded process to manufacture all of Dofira, which takes an average of at least 3 months from the time of wood sourcing to the time finished. We stand behind our products and adhere to the concept of \"One Year Warranty, Lifetime Service\". If there are any questions related to Dofira brand, welcome to contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qc8gXyDoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dofira","source_asin":"B0C2YQVYR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2YQVYR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2YQVYR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
