window.products.push({"id":1164516,"name":"Department 56 Possible Dreams Santa Claus “Good Day for A Ride” Clothtique Christmas Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tMqhAte4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Since 2003, Department 56 artist Ann Dezendorf has led the way in creative direction for the cherished Possible Dreams collection. Possible Dreams uses a unique patented process of sculpting and stiffened fabrics to create multidimensional, lifelike Santa Claus figurines. With designs inspired by Ann’s family and love of Christmas history, these collections capture not only the traditional side of Santa, but also bring light to his off-season hobbies and humorous personality. This year Santa is delivering gifts in style with his favorite helper—Mrs. Claus! In this 9” figurine, Santa drives a festive red motorcycle carrying the toys while the missus sits sidecar keeping track of The List. Possible Dreams features handcrafted Clothtique — stiffened fabric and mixed media details — to create beautiful one-of-a-kind treasures. Each piece is hand-painted to provide a distinctive artistic touch of realism, ensuring the highest quality for years to come. All Possible Dreams figurines come boxed in decorative packaging for easy gifting. About Us: Enesco is committed to bringing joy every day. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, plush, and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: GUND, Department 56 Village, Gregg Gift, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Walt Disney Archives Collection, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Pusheen, Designs by Lolita, Our Name Is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tMqhAte4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B01A9A3KCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A9A3KCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A9A3KCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164517,"name":"Hatchy Birthday Children's Birthday Party Bundle Includes 7 pc Decoration Kit and Jointed Birthday Banner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Gtw0UQJwL._AC_.jpg","description":"Transform your child's party into a magical and memorable experience with the Unique Industries Hatchimals Party Decorating Kit. Designed to delight young fans of the adorable Hatchimals, this all-in-one kit has everything you need to create a festive and enchanting atmosphere.Inside the kit, you'll find a wonderful assortment of party decorations that will transport your little one and their friends to the vibrant world of Hatchtopia. Hang the colorful swirl decorations from the ceiling and watch as they twirl and spin, adding a whimsical touch to the room. The vibrant Hatchimals-themed banner will catch everyone's attention with its eye-catching design, instantly setting the party mood.No celebration is complete without a happy birthday banner, and this decorating kit includes the best Hatchimals-themed banner to add an extra pop of fun and color. This high-quality banner will captivate the young partygoers as they soar through the air, bringing joy and excitement to the celebration.To take your Hatchimals party to the next level, the kit also includes a captivating table centerpiece featuring the adorable Hatchimals characters. It's the perfect centerpiece to anchor your party table, creating a focal point that will make your child feel like they're celebrating right in the heart of Hatchtopia.With the Unique Industries Hatchimals Party Decorating Kit, you don't have to worry about the hassle of searching for individual party decorations. Everything you need is conveniently packed in one box, making party planning a breeze. Whether you're hosting a birthday party, a playdate, or any other special occasion, this decorating kit will add a touch of magic and make your child's celebration truly memorable.Surprise your little Hatchimals enthusiast with this delightful party decorating kit and watch their face light up with joy. Order the Unique Industries Hatchimals Party Decorating Kit today and create a magical party experience that your child will cherish for years to come!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Gtw0UQJwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Binggemen","source_asin":"B07KX3KMGL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KX3KMGL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KX3KMGL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
