window.products.push({"id":1164529,"name":"Greater Los Angeles Map : the Wonder City of America circa 1932 - measures 24 inches x 36 inches (610 mm x 915 mm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sAOvDbsTL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"Map of Greater Los Angeles, The Wonder City of America. Where to Go and What to See.At Carlson Brands , our goal is to produce a selection of the highest quality reproductive art prints, maps & posters. By combining a professional satin PolyPro production material with our state of the art Giclée printing process, we are able to offer the best quality & the most desirable characteristics – accurate colors, archival properties as well as both tear & water resistance. Additionally, for select products, we offer the same quality production on a heavy-gauge artists canvas production material.Our large catalog of first generation images have been digitally captured directly from original documents and therefore display both the original look & tone; sometimes, this may include small tears, flaws and aging, which adds to the authenticity, presentation and beauty of the piece. Ultimately, our process allows us to offer you the opportunity to secure a high quality, low cost image for your home, office or living space...and most are sized to fit into the more economical standard frame formats (frames sold separately). Shipping & Handling We ship art prints, posters & maps in heavy-gauge mailing tubes to ensure that each and every item gets delivered to your door in perfect \"ready to frame\" condition. Guarantee Our customers matter and the quality of your experience is our top priority. In the event that you are not satisfied with any item, you many return it for a replacement or a refund your choice. Shop with Confidence 100% Satisfaction Guarantee No Hassle Exchanges/Returns Safe, Secure & Fast Shipping","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sAOvDbsTL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Antiguos Maps","source_asin":"B00G3OZZFC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164529","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G3OZZFC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G3OZZFC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
