window.products.push({"id":1164640,"name":"Curious Chef 16-Piece Cookie Cutter Collection for Kids, Real Kitchen Cooking and Baking Tools, Dishwasher Safe and Made with BPA-Free Plastic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t0JGwBQwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PLAYFUL DESIGNS, REAL TOOLS: This engaging baking set combines playful designs with real tools, perfect for budding chefs! This collection features youthful and bright colors that captivate children's imaginations, making baking an exciting adventure. Each piece has been rigorously tested and approved by kids, ensuring ease of use and safety. Encouraging creativity and fostering a love for cooking, this baking set is a must-have for girls and boys. KID-FRIENDLY DESIGN: With kid-friendly designs, this collection is specially crafted to fit comfortably and securely for your little ones, ensuring that your mini chefs can truly lend a hand in the kitchen. This also makes a great gift for kids aged 4 and above and a must-have for parties, playdates, holiday baking, and everyday cooking adventures. With its dishwasher-safe and BPA-free construction, it ensures safe and easy cleanup. INCLUDED IN THE SET: This cookie cutter set includes a wide array of shapes: star, rabbit, butterfly, heart, tree, gingerbread man, flower, angel, leaf, bear, cat, ghost, clover, snowman, pumpkin & duck. With their bright colors and soft touch grip, these cutters bring joy to baking. Made of heat-safe silicone up to 450°F, they ensure safety and durability. BUILD A FOUNDATION FOR LIFE SKILLS: The Curious Chef collection helps build a strong foundation for life skills in kids. Encouraging critical thinking, problem-solving, and social interaction, these products foster fine motor skills. By engaging in imaginative play, children develop the essential abilities for success, enabling them to go farther and faster in life. Allow their creativity to shine as they create delightful culinary creations for the entire family to enjoy. THE CURIOUS CHEF DIFFERENCE: Our innovative range offers real utensils and cooking tools. Each product is a result of years of testing and research to ensure functionality and safety. From family gatherings to fun-filled activities, our tools can be utilized on various occasions, empowering children to go on exciting kitchen adventures while fostering their love for cooking. Let them explore the world of flavors and create culinary masterpieces!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t0JGwBQwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Curious Chef","source_asin":"B00GWUE6NE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GWUE6NE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GWUE6NE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
