window.products.push({"id":1164650,"name":"Ceramic Knife and Ceramic Vegetable Peeler Set - Black - New in Packaging!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T9Ng4C5tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ceramic knife and ceramic peeler set is made out of zirconium oxide, which is a high-quality ceramic material that has been developed in the space and medical sectors. It is the best existing material for knives. The blade will stay sharp approximately ten times longer and is about 1/3 lighter than steel knives. The knife provides exceptionally accurate and clean cuts and delivers a comfortable touch handle. Vegetables, meats without the bone and fruit may be cut with very little effort. The ceramic blade does not oxidise food, so fruit and vegetables will not turn brown while being cut. The blade has many other advantages. It is almost as hard as the diamond and does not alter the taste of food or leave an odor. It is non-allergenic, corrosion-resistant, hygienic, and non-magnetic. Food will not stick to it. The ceramic peeler is dishwasher safe and designed with a soft, non-slip, ergonomic handle. Its sharp ceramic blade contours almost any surface shape and easily removes blemishes. The pressure-absorbing rubber handle puts less tension on hands while providing an excellent grip. Ideal for fruits and vegetables, this peeler cuts prep time and will last through many years of kitchen use. It can also be used to shave hard cheese or chocolate. It is delicate enough to peel a tomato skin, but also sharp enough to peel a potato. The blade will deliver precision slicing every time. This ceramic peeler is non-reactive, which means it will not rust and is easy to clean. It is resistant to strong acids and oils so it will not absorb odors or flavors from foods. Any foods that you slice will not leave any after-taste residue. It also keeps fruits and vegetables from browning too quickly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T9Ng4C5tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sure Luxury","source_asin":"B00UCC6G04","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UCC6G04","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UCC6G04","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
