window.products.push({"id":1164678,"name":"ENZOO 20V 4.0Ah Leaf Blower Cordless with Battery and Charger, Work Longer, Dust Vacuum Electric Leaf Blower 2-in-1, for Small Jobs On Yard Garage Sid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UepJ5nf-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With Battery and Charger：The small leaf blower includes a 20V 4.0Ah battery (After fully charged, its working time is about 40-50 minutes. Generally, the working time of a 4.0Ah battery is twice that of a 2.0Ah battery). It is compatible with Makita battery BL1820,if you are not satisfied with the original battery, you can also buy an additional battery yourself. Flexible Versatility - 3 variable air speed, with max up to 130 MPH, designed for sweeping small work areas and hard surfaces such as small yards, patios, driveways, decks, garages, sidewalks, garages, etc. It is recommended for cleaning light objects, such as dry leaves, debris, dust, etc. Multi-Functionality and Effortless - Incorporates both vacuum and blower into one. It is not only a mini leaf blower, but also a dust vacuum, which can suck dust, wood chips and other small things. In addition, it adds an ON locking trigger function for continuous operation, without the need to press the switch all the time to make the machine work continuously, which can reduce fatigue. please note that vacuuming leaves is not recommended. Ergonomically Portable - At only 3.5 pounds, it maximizes one-arm maneuverability and minimizes bodily stress. It is lightweight and highly recommend for children, women,people with weaker bones or elderly people. Design to Accessorize - Removable chute or nozzle extender to increase reach and blower efficiency; detachable bag with an easy release for dust and small debris collection. The volume of the leaf blower is very small,you can pack it for storage or take it to travel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UepJ5nf-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ENZOO","source_asin":"B08LPDS3VZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LPDS3VZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LPDS3VZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
