window.products.push({"id":1164683,"name":"Winarrive salt shaker, salt and pepper shakers with magnetic design, salt cellar with push button, salt and pepper bowls for Kitchen Cooking Table, RV","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515k69KPPtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Accuracy Control：Our salt and pepper shakers has a push button, which can sprinkle 0.5g of salt with a single push, so as to accurately control the amount of salt and ensure healthy eating habits. If you need to use a lot of salt, as long as you keep pressing and holding the button, the salt will keep sprinkling down until you release the button. Save Space: This ration salt shaker with magnetic design, you can not only put it on the kitchen table or spice rack, you can also stick it on the kitchen wall, cabinet door or even the refrigerator or anywhere you want to use it. Our magnetic base will hold the salt shaker to it and it won't fall off, so it's very space-saving. Perfect Design：The storage space of the salt bottle adopts transparent design, so that you can directly see the types and allowance of seasonings, don't worry about using the wrong seasonings, and always know if you need to supplement them. We also upgraded the leak at the bottom of the salt bottle. No matter salt, chili powder, pepper and various small particle seasonings, they can be left in the leak smoothly without jamming. Seals Closed and Refills: The lid of the salt shaker we processed with a special process and is very easy to remove. Just twist counterclockwise to remove the lid for quick cleaning and rinsing, dry it and add seasoning and re-tighten it clockwise to reseal it again. (Please note that salt shakers can only be washed by hand, please do not use the dishwasher. Warm reminder: We warmly welcome customers to buy with our high-quality service. If you have any product questions, please feel free to contact us, and we will provide you with a satisfactory solution on every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515k69KPPtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winarrive","source_asin":"B0BKWPP3J2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKWPP3J2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKWPP3J2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
