window.products.push({"id":1164781,"name":"Giantex Modern Dining Chairs Set of 4 - Upholstered Arm Dining Chair with Steel Legs, Thick Sponge Seat, Non-Slipping Pads, Modern Leisure Chair for D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aSEdLXVCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: Giantex dining chair is a comfy addition to improve your life quality. Each kitchen chair is upholstered by superior leathaire, which is breathable and wear resistant. Plus, its weak alkalinity is very friendly to your skin. Also, each leisure chair has a removable cushion padded with high-density sponge. Supported by metal legs, using stability is well ensured, while adjustable foot pads are helpful to maintain good balance on the uneven floor. During a long-time sitting, ergonomic backrests and armrests will offer ample support for an enjoyable sitting experience. Finally, the installation is very simple. Features: Detachable cushion designed for easy cleaning Metal legs offer strong support without wobbling Easy and quick installation with a detailed manual High-density sponge with ideal softness for great comfort Adjustable pads maintain good balance even on uneven floor Hook and loop fasteners easy to install and remove the cushion Perfect for dining room, study, living room, reception room and more Ergonomic backrest perfectly matches human back for fatigue relief Covered with leathaire fabric which is breathable and wear resistant Specifications: Color: Pink Material: Leathaire, Sponge, Metal, Plywood Overall Dimension: 22.5x23x33inch (L x W x H) Size of Seat: 16x18inch (L x W x H) Seat Above the Floor: 18inch(with Cushion) Max Load Capacity: 330lbs Net Weight: 27lbs Package Includes: 4 x Dining Chair 1 x User Guide","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aSEdLXVCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B093P5ZJGT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164781","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093P5ZJGT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093P5ZJGT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164782,"name":"3 PCS Small Wall Tapestry The Sun Moon And Star Tarot Tapestries Wall Hanging Aesthetic Bohemian Black And White Tapestry For Bed Room Home Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IWqUZgXLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE SUN Tapestry ——Symbol inchLifeinch The sun symbolizes joy, inner peace, and the need to express oneself. It also means understanding that happiness is a choice. The sun represents joy, peace, happiness and creativity. There is also liberation and freedom. The sun represents a pleasant relief. It means that the power of awakening is sufficient to drive out darkness. THE MOON Tapestry ——Symbol inchUneasyinch This is a card that represents confusion and anxiety. In the moonlight, the lobster crawled out of the water and walked towards the moon goddess. It had to choose the correct one of the two high towers in the distance, because that tower was the only way to see the moon goddess. THE STAR Tapestry ——Symbol inchHopeinch This is a card full of hope. Under the shining of the star of hope, Sirius, the goddess of hope pours the holy water of holy water in the holy water bottle into the pool that symbolizes the subconscious. She knew that people needed hope so much, so when one bottle of holy water was poured out, she was pouring another bottle. Premium Material: The tapestries are lightweight and easy to hang, skin-friendly, soft, odorless, durable and not easy to fade. HD DIGITAL PRINTING: Clear and does not fade Non-toxic ink-Take care of your family's health. No weird smell- keep your room smelling of happiness. Clearly- Adopting HD print and crisp lines, clearly and not fade, enough to light your room. Size Information: The star, moon and sun tapestry measures 20 x 16 Inches or 50 x 40 cms. Suitable for wall hanging decoration. Package Include: 1 × Moon Tapestry 1 × Sun Tapestry 1 × Star Tapestry Warm Notice: Color difference allowed due to lighting and screen effects. Please allow tiny size error due to manual measurement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IWqUZgXLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NA-1","source_asin":"B09C77DL7D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C77DL7D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C77DL7D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
