window.products.push({"id":1164940,"name":"Longaberger Dessert Bowls Paprika Set of 2 Pottery New In Box Bowls USA Genuine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919FmYTRh4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Longaberger Paprika Red Dessert Bowls Set of 2 New in Box. Made in the USA!! Condition: New in original packaging and stored in a smoke-free environment. Size: approx 4 1/4\" round x approx 2 1/4 high. Longaberger Pottery is American Vitrified, which means that it has less than .05% absorption. To the consumer, this means that it won't pick up contamination. It also has high impact and chip resistibility, a high gloss glaze, a glazed foot for safe stacking and is freezer, oven, microwave, and dishwasher safe.\" Info from Bentley book.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919FmYTRh4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Longaberger","source_asin":"B00LLGNB0I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LLGNB0I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LLGNB0I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1164941,"name":"Viewtainer Slit-Top 4-Pack - 2.75\" (Pink/Raspberry)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nWHqc1vML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"CLEAR CANISTER STORAGE - Organizing your tools, crafts, and other items is great until you forget what is inside the container. Viewtainer’s clear canister style storage containers make it easy to see what is inside. You won’t have to break out the label maker or open multiple boxes to find what you need. Take your organization to the next level with these clear containers with colored lids. SPILL-PROOF PLASTIC CONTAINERS - Our clear storage containers are made of durable plastic with a secured vinyl lid to keep your items safely inside. The vinyl lid comes with a slit top to easily access the inside of your Viewtainer with a simple squeeze. The easy open lid will remain shut and keep all of your screws or ribbons inside even if it is tipped upside down or dropped. MEDIUM SIZED SET - This four-pack set of Viewtainers helps you organize small to mid-sized items. You receive 4 slit-top storage containers: two pink (2.75” X 5”) and two raspberry (2.75” X 8”). This set comes with lids in a variety of primary colors to help you color coordinate your tools, craft room, and storage closets. This set is a perfect gift for a new homeowner, parent, or handyman. ORGANIZE TOOLS, CRAFTS, AND TOYS - These versatile clear plastic storage containers make one part of life a little bit easier. We understand that the busy lives of craftsman, nurses, teachers, and even kids require a little help through organization. Organize the garage, classroom, bathroom, or crafts and hobbies so you can clearly see what you need and access it easily. MADE IN THE USA - All of Viewtainer’s storage containers and secure lids are made in the United States. We believe in creating high-quality products that you can trust to store your precious tools, hobbies, and crafts. Viewtainers are made to stand up to the drops that may occur in the workshop. The slit top will keep its shape even after repeated squeezes, so you can use it for every project.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nWHqc1vML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viewtainer","source_asin":"B07992F7RJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1164941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07992F7RJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07992F7RJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
